Description: Uniquenium desktop enhancement application
 Uniquenium is a cross-platform desktop enhancement application that provides
 custom wallpaper management, cursor themes, global hotkeys, and system tray
 integration. It supports both Windows and Linux (X11/Wayland) environments.
 .
 This package contains the main executable.

