Description: Uniquenium shared library (Uniquenium0)
 Uniquenium is a cross-platform desktop enhancement application that provides
 custom wallpaper management, cursor themes, global hotkeys, and system tray
 integration.
 .
 This package contains the shared library used by Uniquenium.

Package: uniquenium-data
Section: utils
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Uniquenium data files (QML, icons, translations)
 Uniquenium is a cross-platform desktop enhancement application that provides
 custom wallpaper management, cursor themes, global hotkeys, and system tray
 integration.
 .
 This package contains architecture-independent data files such as QML
 components, icons, and translations used by Uniquenium.
